  "thesis": "A positive daily MACD histogram may identify strengthening BTC trend momentum early enough that a causal next-open long/cash policy preserves material upside while avoiding sufficiently adverse paths to improve fee-adjusted risk-adjusted performance over full-capital buy-and-hold.",
  "economic_rationale": "The mechanism requires a fast exponentially weighted price trend to exceed both a slower trend and the smoothed recent state of that spread. It is useful only if the default 12/26/9 tuple retains material after-cost upside, lowers drawdown, improves Calmar, survives annual breadth and remains stable at two frozen fast-length neighbors. Reduced exposure alone cannot pass.",
  "opportunity_cost": "Test one widely documented, executable close-only momentum state before allocating more research to external data, another DRA exit variant or waiting-only forward families.",
